      <purpose>Store arbitrary dose-volume histogram (DVH) parameters derived from the DICOM RT DVH caching layer. Metric names are free text.</purpose>
      <keywords>DVH; radiotherapy; DICOM RT DVH; DICA</keywords>
      <use>Per the EHRCON26 abstract; see archetypes/README.md.</use>
    </details>
